t-screen television, a circular thermostat and a small wireless speaker on a low rounded shelf. Arrange the television behind the smaller devices so each remains recognizable, with cables concealed and proportions consistent. Show matte ivory housings, satin aluminum rims, finely perforated speaker fabric and softly reflective screen glass. An orthographic three-quarter camera keeps straight edges tidy. Gentle daylight from the upper left casts broad shadows on a pale sage background, while a small amber indicator adds a restrained technology accent. Precise beveled 3D product illustration with clean separation between materials and generous surrounding space. No text, letters, logos, or watermarks.","replacement_prompt":"미니멀 아이콘 형태의 스마트 TV와 온도조절기가 조화를 이루는 3D 아트"},{"id":"ca7b6f05-cc51-4658-85b2-057c42dcfefe","style_id":"3d_digital","label":"#3D 동물 동화 캐릭터","display_order":10,"created_at":"2026-10-09 03:52:55.021591+00","expected_prompt":"A round young brown bear sits cross-legged on a moss-green cushion, carefully opening a large illustrated storybook in its lap. Give it soft rounded ears, a small dark nose, curious eyes and a knitted mustard cardigan with visible cuff stitches. Its paws support the lower corners of the book; the pages contain simple unlettered shapes. Stage the bear in a miniature reading nook with a low shelf and a softly glowing lamp. A close three-quarter view reveals layered fur clumps, slightly creased paper and cushion fabric. Warm lamp light mixes gently with cool window fill, creating a tender stylized 3D storybook scene. No text, letters, logos, or watermarks.","replacement_prompt":"책 읽는 귀여운 3D 아기 곰돌이 캐릭터, 부드러운 3D 질감"},{"id":"9d44489f-1c56-4b34-8d0c-4978353e3564","style_id":"architectural","label":"#건축 인테리어","display_order":1,"created_at":"2026-10-09 03:52:55.021591+00","expected_prompt":"A quiet luxury living room opens through floor-to-ceiling glazing onto a dense green forest. Frame a low linen sofa, an oak coffee table and a board-forme