he sculpture a clearly grounded shadow; concealed wall washing gently brightens the darker passage. Continuous floor joints, a visible handrail at a level change and realistic ceiling thickness make the building credible. Quiet, precise architectural visualization with restrained colors. No text, letters, logos, or watermarks.","replacement_prompt":"곡선형 콘크리트 벽면과 천장 천창 라이팅이 예술적인 현대 미술관"},{"id":"5e60c4a3-15ae-48f5-9910-e30da062dc13","style_id":"architectural","label":"#스파 바이오필릭 바스","display_order":10,"created_at":"2026-10-09 03:52:55.021591+00","expected_prompt":"A freestanding natural-stone bathtub stands beside a wide window overlooking a secluded bamboo garden. A wooden bath tray, folded linen towel and small ceramic vessel add restrained spa details. View diagonally across the tub with a 35mm lens so its rim, floor contact and window-side reflections remain clear. Diffuse morning light reveals mineral veins, softly honed stone, small droplets on the rim and the grain of a teak floor mat. Bamboo shadows fall gently across limewashed walls; a light veil of steam stays close to the water surface. Realistic architectural spa photography with soft contrast and believable scale. No text, letters, logos, or watermarks.","replacement_prompt":"자연 석재 욕조와 대나무 숲 뷰가 차분함을 주는 바이오필릭 욕실"},{"id":"641ea392-db1b-4e8b-bb11-86d0029c9358","style_id":"artistic_editorial","label":"#패션 룩북 화보","display_order":1,"created_at":"2026-10-09 03:52:55.021591+00","expected_prompt":"A Korean woman in her late twenties models a sand-colored spring trench coat in a minimal warm-gray studio. She shifts her weight naturally onto one leg, lightly holding the lapel so the collar, belt and double-breasted construction read clearly. Frame a full-length fashion photograph with a 70mm lens, leaving space above her head and keeping shoes entirely visible. Broad window-like light from camera left reveals cotton twill, stitching, sleeve creases and natural skin texture; a soft reflected fill retains detail on th