l clutter. Crisp edges and generous margins create a modern music poster; the record's center label remains blank. No text, letters, logos, or watermarks.","replacement_prompt":"LP 플레이어와 턴테이블이 강렬한 컬러 콘트라스트로 표현된 플랫 그래픽"},{"id":"56e780d5-f959-4e7f-882b-7c01407a872f","style_id":"minimal_flat","label":"#커피 모노톤 일러스트","display_order":5,"created_at":"2026-10-09 03:52:55.021591+00","expected_prompt":"A modern coffee-branding illustration groups a cup, a curved steam shape and three coffee beans on a simple round tabletop. Use only flat shades of espresso brown, warm taupe and cream, with the cup handle and saucer clearly separated. Compose asymmetrically with the cup in the lower half and broad negative space above. Shape overlap and a single darker block define depth without realistic shading, paper distress or photographic texture. Clean geometric curves and consistent edge treatment give the design a quiet premium identity suitable for a poster or packaging background. No text, letters, logos, or watermarks.","replacement_prompt":"모노톤 브라운 톤의 그래픽 도형으로 구성된 모던 커피 브랜딩 포스터"},{"id":"97a88c3d-88c6-4435-b530-26080bb9b72b","style_id":"minimal_flat","label":"#시티 브리즈 플랫","display_order":6,"created_at":"2026-10-09 03:52:55.021591+00","expected_prompt":"A Korean adult wearing sunglasses drives a small convertible along a palm-lined coastal boulevard. Show a simplified side-three-quarter silhouette with the driver's head, windscreen and car wheels clearly readable. Broad teal sky, warm peach road and dark-green palm shapes create a breezy minimal flat-art composition. Use a single curved road band and two staggered palms to suggest movement and distance without realistic perspective effects. Crisp color-block edges, an uncluttered sun circle and generous space ahead of the car make the scene feel light and modern. The vehicle is unbranded. No text, letters, logos, or watermarks.","replacement_prompt":"선글라스를 끼고 야자수 도로를 달리는 자동차의 모던 미니멀 플랫 아트"},{"id":"1724a9f1-56ae-4637-a556-158aa6c6cf18