luted gray washes to describe soft fabric folds. Darker dry-brush marks define hair and the fan's bamboo ribs, while tiny muted red accents mark the blossoms. Visible hanji fibers, irregular ink edges and restrained brush pressure create an authentic Korean ink-and-light-color painting. No text, letters, logos, or watermarks.","replacement_prompt":"은은한 수묵 먹선과 한지 질감 속 아련한 분위기의 한복 입은 선비와 매화 가지"},{"id":"2db63418-e270-4b46-975c-2c7bc64db01c","style_id":"oriental_ink","label":"#경복궁 수묵 산수화","display_order":2,"created_at":"2026-10-09 03:52:55.021591+00","expected_prompt":"Gyeongbokgung Palace's broad-roofed main hall sits beneath the distant peaks of Samgaksan on a misty morning. Compose a traditional Korean landscape with a low stone courtyard in the foreground, layered palace rooflines in the middle and mountain ridges dissolving into unpainted haze. Use dense dark ink for tile eaves and pine branches, lighter broken washes for distant rock faces and broad paper reserves for fog. Delicate brush lines distinguish timber columns without turning the scene into a technical drawing. Subtle hanji texture and restrained gray tonal transitions establish depth and quiet grandeur. No text, letters, logos, or watermarks.","replacement_prompt":"안개 낀 아침 삼각산과 경복궁 대웅전이 먹선의 짙고 옅음으로 그려진 동양 수묵화"},{"id":"5248cf05-eaee-4f36-9601-f063318cf99f","style_id":"oriental_ink","label":"#달빛 매화 대나무","display_order":3,"created_at":"2026-10-09 03:52:55.021591+00","expected_prompt":"Slender bamboo leaves and a flowering white plum branch overlap beneath a pale round moon in an open, asymmetrical ink composition. Let one branch enter from the lower corner and rise diagonally, leaving generous untouched paper around the moon. Use swift tapered dark strokes for bamboo, dry-brush texture for the older plum bark and soft gray washes to suggest a cool night atmosphere. White blossoms are defined by reserved paper and faint ink edges, with only a few muted red centers. Korean ink-and-light-color painting on fibrous hanji, emphasizing brush rhythm and tonal balance. No text, letters, logos, or watermarks.","replacement_prompt":"둥근 은달빛 아래 대나무 잎과 흰 매화가 번진 조선 전통 수묵 채색화"},{"id":"1f28fb4a-3c68-4902-b8e3-7b67e518a565","style_id":"oriental_ink","label":"#수묵 호랑이 기상","display_order":4,"created_at":"2026-10-09 03:52:55.021591+00","expected_prompt":"A powerful tiger stands on a low rock ledge, head turned slightly toward the viewer and mouth open in a restrained roar. Compose a three-quarter full-body ink painting that clearly shows the planted paws, shoulder mass and sweeping tail. Use confident dark brush strokes for the stripes, diluted ink for the fur's changing volume and delicate dry-brush marks around the whiskers. A small pine branch and pale mountain wash establish a Korean landscape without crowding the animal. Warm ivory hanji remains visible through the lighter fur, with minimal muted ochre accents and expressive controlled brushwork. No text, letters, logos, or watermarks.","replacement_prompt":"용맹한 기세로 호효하는 호랑이의 기품 있는 먹선 수묵 드로잉"},{"id":"983e0065-b38d-4536-9ace-2d4d4c9fcf86","style_id":"oriental_ink","label":"#한옥과 소나무 산수","display_order":5,"created_at":"2026-10-09 03:52:55.021591+00","expected_prompt":"A small tiled-roof hanok rests on a pine-covered hillside above a valley of drifting cloud. Place a dark twisted pine in the foreground, the house and stone path in the middle distance and pale mountain ridges beyond. Vary the ink density deliberately: dry, textured strokes for bark and roof tiles, broken washes for rocky slopes and almost transparent gray for distant peaks. Leave broad paper reserves to form the moving mist, allowing the house to feel sheltered rather than isolated. Traditional Korean landscape painting on textured hanji with a restrained green-gray wash and calm asymmetrical composition. No text, letters, logos, or watermarks.","replacement_prompt":"구름에 휩싸인 소나무 언덕 위 아담한 한옥 기와집의 은은한 수묵화"},{"id":"330a8bf8-5485-44dc-aef8-1e7e099d37ec","style_id":"oriental_i