ositions. Warm window light contrasts with cool corridor shade, while the background remains less detailed than the faces. A quiet romantic everyday scene with clear visual storytelling. No text, letters, logos, or watermarks.","replacement_prompt":"학교 복도 창가 햇살 아래 서로 바라보는 고등학생 남녀 웹툰 명장면"},{"id":"300b8a82-0b3d-4a44-9182-637707fdab07","style_id":"webtoon_lineart","label":"#도시 몬스터 웹툰","display_order":3,"created_at":"2026-10-09 03:52:55.021591+00","expected_prompt":"An original giant stone-like monster emerges between the buildings near Gangnam Station while a small Korean adult hero stands in the foreground facing it. Use a low wide single-panel composition with traffic barriers and an empty crossing to establish the monster's scale. Keep the hero's silhouette clear against a lighter road surface and the creature's limbs structurally readable. Bold ink contours, sharp cel shadows and selective debris strokes create tension without graphic injury. The city has simplified unlettered storefront panels and coherent architectural perspective. Detailed Korean action-webtoon art with a controlled focal point and strong depth. No text, letters, logos, or watermarks.","replacement_prompt":"서울 강남역 한복판에 나타난 거대 몬스터와 이에 맞서는 웹툰 히어로"},{"id":"b2fc1540-207e-44cc-8a0b-c61016fe0927","style_id":"webtoon_lineart","label":"#무협 웹툰 검사","display_order":4,"created_at":"2026-10-09 03:52:55.021591+00","expected_prompt":"A Korean fantasy swordsman in a long Joseon-inspired robe stands on a rocky ridge, one hand resting on the scabbard and the other holding a lowered sword. Wind pulls the robe and tied hair consistently to one side. Frame a medium-full low-angle panel that preserves readable feet, sword grip and body balance. Use flowing variable-width ink lines for fabric, crisp cel shadows beneath folds and sparse brush-textured marks for distant mountains. A pale sky separates the dark silhouette while a warm rim defines the robe's edge. Original martial-arts webtoon illustration with restrained dramatic movement. No text, letters, logos, or watermarks.","replacement_prompt":"바람에 도포 자락이 날리는 조선 판타지 무협 웹툰의 검객"},{"id":"d69f987f-2781-49fc-bf70-f551177fed30","style_id":"webtoon_lineart","label":"#사이버 헌터 웹툰","display_order":5,"created_at":"2026-10-09 03:52:55.021591+00","expected_prompt":"An original Korean adult hunter in a charcoal tactical coat faces a newly opened luminous gate in a modern city square. Show a medium-wide three-quarter panel with the hunter in the foreground, one hand raised toward the unstable portal and empty buildings receding behind. Bold clean linework and decisive cel shading distinguish fabric straps, armor inserts and the face. Blue portal light illuminates the near sleeve and pavement; restrained warm streetlight separates the opposite edge. Geometric energy fragments remain organized around the gate rather than covering the character. Detailed Korean fantasy-action webtoon art with coherent perspective and readable anatomy. No text, letters, logos, or watermarks.","replacement_prompt":"게이트가 열린 현대 도시에서 각성한 S급 헌터의 웹툰 일러스트"},{"id":"fdff3bdc-a146-4d2c-ab73-7716ae221568","style_id":"webtoon_lineart","label":"#로맨스 판타지 영애","display_order":6,"created_at":"2026-10-09 03:52:55.021591+00","expected_prompt":"An original Korean-featured adult heroine in an ornate pale-blue ball gown pauses on a grand palace stair, gently lifting the skirt's edge with one gloved hand. Frame a medium-full three-quarter panel with a curved banister leading toward tall softly lit windows. Fine webtoon ink lines distinguish lace borders, small pearl ornaments and layered fabric folds; clean cel shadows describe the gown's volume without flattening its silhouette. Warm light touches the face and jeweled hair accessory while cool blue shadows preserve the dress detail. Elegant original romance-fantasy illustration with restrained decorative sparkles and a calm expression. No text, letters, logos, or watermarks.","replacement_prompt":"화려한 영애 드레스를 입은 로맨스 판타지 웹툰 여주인공"},{"id":"c5b695f7-4611-4fab-bd6a-02791867e514","style_id":"webtoon_lineart","label":"#음식 웹툰 먹방","display_order":7,"created_at":"2026-10-09 03:52:55.021591+00","expected_prompt":"A steaming plate of tteokbokki and crisp golden fried snacks fills a single appetizing Korean food-webtoon panel. Place glossy rice cakes in a shallow bowl with a plain wooden skewer resting safely on the rim; arrange the fried vegetables and dumplings on a separate small tray. Use a close three-quarter tabletop view with bold outer contours and finer ingredient lines. Clean cel shading and small controlled highlights distinguish thick red sauce, chewy rice-cake surfaces and rough fried batter. Steam curls upward against a simple warm background, with restrained color gradients rather than photographic texture. No text, letters, logos, or watermarks.","replacement_prompt":"김이 모락모락 나는 떡볶이와 튀김이 먹음직스럽게 그려진 웹툰 컷"},{"id":"8448bf17-36b3-4ba8-add4-b936fc23fc2c","style_id":"webtoon_lineart","label":"#스포츠 웹툰 슬램","display_order":8,"created_at":"2026-10-09 03:52:55.021591+00","expected_prompt":"A Korean basketball player rises for a jump shot on an indoor court, the ball just leaving both naturally positioned hands above the forehead. Frame a low three-quarter action panel with visible planted-to-lift body mechanics, bent legs and a distant backboard establishing the shot direction. Bold webtoon contours and sharp cel shadows define jersey folds, forearm muscles and shoe shapes. Use sparse motion lines following the upward jump, while keeping the face and ball unobstructed. Warm court reflections and cool background bleachers provide clear depth. Original sports-webtoon illustration with balanced anatomy and a decisive single moment. No text, letters, logos, or watermarks.","replacement_prompt":"농구 코트 위에서 역동적으로 슛을 던지는 스포츠 웹툰 명장면"},{"id":"2b46e126-7946-4d03-bd3b-c64908942c3d","style_id":"webtoon_lineart","label":"#일상 인디 웹툰","display_order":9,"created_at":"2026-10-09 03:52:55.021591+00","expected_prompt":"A Korean young adult lounges on a floor cushion beside a sleeping tabby cat in a small cozy studio apartment. One hand rests lightly near the cat while the other holds a closed book; the posture feels relaxed and anatomically comfortable. Frame a wide everyday-life webtoon panel with a low table, a potted plant and softly folded bedding defining the lived-in room. Gentle variable-width ink lines, simple cel shadows and a muted cream-sage palette keep the scene warm and uncluttered. Afternoon window light creates a soft rectangle on the floor, with details concentrated around the person and cat. No text, letters, logos, or watermarks.","replacement_prompt":"자취방에서 반려묘와 누워있는 소소한 일상 한국 웹툰 일러스트"},{"id":"4fe0c653-2f08-473c-b172-3023c3238bd0","style_id":"webtoon_lineart","label":"#스릴러 웹툰 인물","display_order":10,"created_at":"2026-10-09 03:52:55.021591+00","expected_prompt":"An original Korean adult detective studies a small unlettered evidence photograph inside a dim office, looking past it with a focused, guarded expression. Frame a close three-quarter portrait with one eye clearly lit and the gripping hand visible near the lower edge. Fine ink lines define brow tension, hair strands and coat seams, while heavy cel shadows shape the cheek and background. A cool desk lamp provides the main light and a narrow warm doorway glow separates the shoulder. Sparse crosshatching and controlled reflections create suspense without obscuring the face. Detailed Korean thriller-webtoon illustration. No text, letters, logos, or watermarks.","replacement_prompt":"어두운 조명 속 차가운 눈빛을 한 추리 웹툰 주인공 포트레이트"}]$catalog_payload$::jsonb;
  matched_count integer;
  changed_count integer;
BEGIN
  SET LOCAL lock_timeout = '5s';
  SET LOCAL statement_timeout = '30s';
  LOCK TABLE public.style_preset_prompts IN SHARE ROW EXCLUSIVE MODE;
  IF (SELECT count(*) FROM public.style_preset_prompts) <> 160 THEN
    RAISE EXCEPTION 'Template count changed; review current catalog before applying';
  END IF;
  SELECT count(*) INTO matched_count
  FROM public.style_preset_prompts p
  JOIN jsonb_to_recordset(payload) AS e(id uuid, style_id text, label text, display_order integer, created_at timestamptz, expected_prompt text)
    ON p.id = e.id
  WHERE p.style_id = e.style_id AND p.label = e.label
    AND p.display_order = e.display_order AND p.created_at = e.created_at
    AND p.prompt = e.expected_prompt;
  IF matched_count <> 160 THEN
    RAISE EXCEPTION 'Template content or identity changed (%/160 match); refusing to overwrite', matched_count;
  END IF;
  UPDATE public.style_preset_prompts p
  SET prompt = e.replacement_prompt
  FROM jsonb_to_recordset(payload) AS e(id uuid, replacement_prompt text)
  WHERE p.id = e.id;
  GET DIAGNOSTICS changed_count = ROW_COUNT;
  IF changed_count <> 160 THEN
    RAISE EXCEPTION 'Unexpected updated count: %', changed_count;
  END IF;
END
$release$;
SELECT style_id, count(*) AS count, min(length(prompt)) AS shortest, max(length(prompt)) AS longest
FROM public.style_preset_prompts GROUP BY style_id ORDER BY style_id;
